## Rules
- Never commit secrets. All secrets go in environment variables, documented in .env.example.
- Every new API endpoint needs: input validation, auth check, authorization check (via can()), tests.
- Every database change goes through a migration file. Never edit the DB by hand.
- Run lint, typecheck and tests before saying a task is done.
- Never modify a test to make it pass. If a test reveals a bug, fix the code or report it.
- Ask before adding a new dependency.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes. One feature per branch. Never push directly to main.
- Commit messages follow Conventional Commits.

## Commands
- Dev: [npm run dev]
- Test: [npm test]
- Lint/typecheck: [npm run lint && npm run typecheck]
- Migrate: [npx prisma migrate dev]

